      <!-- SERVICES TEASER -->
      <section>
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head reveal">
            <div class="stack">
              <p class="eyebrow">What We Do</p>
              <h2>A Ride For Every Occasion</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="lede">From a 5am airport run to a wedding day timeline that can't slip, we build every trip around
              your schedule.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-3">
            <a href="/service" class="card reveal">
              <div class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M3 11l18-8-8 18-2-8-8-2z" />
                </svg></div>
              <h3>Airport Transfers</h3>
              <p>YVR and Abbotsford Airport pickups with flight tracking and a meet-and-greet at arrivals.</p>
              <span class="card-link">Learn more <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"
                  stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
                </svg></span>
            </a>
            <a href="/service" class="card reveal">
              <div class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <circle cx="9" cy="14" r="5" />
                  <circle cx="15" cy="14" r="5" />
                </svg></div>
              <h3>Weddings</h3>
              <p>A calm, precisely-timed ride for the whole wedding party — from getting-ready to send-off.</p>
              <span class="card-link">Learn more <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"
                  stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
                </svg></span>
            </a>
            <a href="/service" class="card reveal">
              <div class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="13" rx="2" />
                  <path d="M8 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2" />
                  <path d="M3 12h18" />
                </svg></div>
              <h3>Corporate Travel</h3>
              <p>Discreet, on-time executive transport for meetings, roadshows and client visits.</p>
              <span class="card-link">Learn more <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"
                  stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
                </svg></span>
            </a>
            <a href="/service" class="card reveal">
              <div class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="10" rx="2" />
                  <circle cx="7" cy="19" r="1.6" />
                  <circle cx="17" cy="19" r="1.6" />
                  <path d="M2 12h20" />
                </svg></div>
              <h3>Night Out &amp; Parties</h3>
              <p>Party bus energy for birthdays, bachelor(ette) nights and nights on the town.</p>
              <span class="card-link">Learn more <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"
                  stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
                </svg></span>
            </a>
            <a href="/service" class="card reveal">
              <div class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M7 3h10" />
                  <path d="M12 3c0 4-4 4-4 8a4 4 0 0 0 8 0c0-4-4-4-4-8" />
                  <path d="M12 15v6" />
                  <path d="M9 21h6" />
                </svg></div>
              <h3>Wine &amp; Brewery Tours</h3>
              <p>An unhurried loop through Fraser Valley wineries and craft breweries, no designated driver required.
              </p>
              <span class="card-link">Learn more <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"
                  stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
                </svg></span>
            </a>
            <a href="/service" class="card reveal">
              <div class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M3 20l6-11 4 7 3-5 5 9z" />
                </svg></div>
              <h3>Whistler Ski Trips</h3>
              <p>A relaxed ride up the Sea-to-Sky Highway — skis and boards fit fine, traffic is somebody else's
                problem.</p>
              <span class="card-link">Learn more <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"
                  stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
                </svg></span>
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="center" style="margin-top:44px;">
            <a href="/service" class="btn btn-ghost">View All Services</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FLEET TEASER -->
      <section
        style="background:var(--panel-2); border-top:1px solid var(--line); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head reveal">
            <div class="stack">
              <p class="eyebrow">Our Fleet</p>
              <h2>Two Ways To Arrive</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="lede">Refined and quiet, or loud and full of your best friends — either way, someone else is
              driving.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-2">
            <div class="card reveal">
              <div class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M3 13l2-5a2 2 0 0 1 2-1h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 1l2 5" />
                  <rect x="2" y="13" width="20" height="6" rx="2" />
                  <circle cx="7" cy="19" r="1.6" />
                  <circle cx="17" cy="19" r="1.6" />
                </svg></div>
              <h3>Stretch Limousine</h3>
              <p>Leather seating, ambient lighting and a privacy divider — built for weddings, proms and airport
                arrivals that should feel like an occasion.</p>
              <span class="card-link">See full specs <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"
                  stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
                </svg></span>
            </div>
            <a href="/fleet" class="card reveal">
              <div class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="10" rx="2" />
                  <circle cx="7" cy="19" r="1.6" />
                  <circle cx="17" cy="19" r="1.6" />
                  <path d="M2 12h20" />
                </svg></div>
              <h3>Party Bus</h3>
              <p>LED lighting and a premium sound system for groups who want the night to start the second the doors
                close.</p>
              <span class="card-link">See full specs <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8"
                  stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
                </svg></span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- SERVICE AREA -->
      <section class="section-tight">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-head reveal">
            <div class="stack">
              <p class="eyebrow">Where We Drive</p>
              <h2>Metro Vancouver To The Mountains</h2>
              <p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px;">Based in Surrey, running the whole Lower Mainland, the Fraser
                Valley and the Sea-to-Sky corridor up to Whistler.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="area-pill-row reveal">
            <span class="area-pill">Vancouver</span>
            <span class="area-pill">Surrey</span>
            <span class="area-pill">Burnaby</span>
            <span class="area-pill">Richmond</span>
            <span class="area-pill">Langley</span>
            <span class="area-pill">Coquitlam</span>
            <span class="area-pill">Abbotsford</span>
            <span class="area-pill">Chilliwack</span>
            <span class="area-pill">Squamish</span>
            <span class="area-pill">Whistler</span>
            <span class="area-pill">Seattle</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- WHY CHOOSE US -->
      <section>
        <div class="container two-col">
          <div class="reveal">
            <p class="eyebrow">Why Ride With Us</p>
            <h2 style="margin-top:14px;">Built Around Punctuality</h2>
            <ul class="check-list" style="margin-top:32px;">
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                </svg> Licensed &amp; insured chauffeurs</li>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                </svg> Meticulously maintained vehicles</li>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                </svg> Punctual, door-to-door service</li>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                </svg> Discreet and professional throughout</li>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                </svg> Flexible for groups of any size</li>
              <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5" />
                </svg> Available 24/7, by appointment</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="reveal">
            <div class="testimonial-slot" style="margin-bottom:24px;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M7 8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2v-6zm10 0a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2v-6z" />
              </svg>
              <span>Client reviews are on their way — book your ride and be one of our first featured stories.</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
              <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:14px;">Good To Know</p>
              <p style="color:var(--ivory); font-size:1rem;">Every quote is built around your date, distance and
                headcount — call or send a request and we'll confirm the right vehicle for your event within the day.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- CTA BAND -->
      <section class="cta-band">
        <div class="container">
          <p class="eyebrow center">Ready When You Are</p>
          <h2>Let's Get You Moving.</h2>
          <p class="lede center">Fill out a quick request or call us directly — either way, we'll have a chauffeur
            confirmed in no time.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="/book" class="btn btn-primary">Book a Ride</a>
            <a href="tel:+16723773932" class="btn btn-ghost">Call (672) 377-3932</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

